{
  "file": "module4",
  "page": 29,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.44091796875,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "study objectives were to evaluate the efficacy of: 1) a rifapentine-containing regimen to determine",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.2609252929688,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "whether the single substitution of rifapentine for rifampicin makes it possible to reduce the duration of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.974470138549805,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.0918579101562,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "treatment for drug-susceptible pulmonary TB to four months; and 2) a rifapentine-containing regimen",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.962486267089844,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.5838012695312,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "that additionally substitutes moxifloxacin for ethambutol and continues moxifloxacin throughout",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        527.5785522460938,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "treatment, to determine whether the duration of treatment can be reduced, compared with the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        132.1147003173828,
        527.3963012695312,
        147.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "(27) currently recommended 6-month regimen using a non-inferiority margin of 6.6 percentage points  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.953752517700195,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.09461975097656,
        527.4266967773438,
        169.53761291503906
      ],
      "text": "The rifapentine-moxifloxacin arm was the only arm to demonstrate non-inferiority when compared",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        168.2946319580078,
        527.6209106445312,
        182.7376251220703
      ],
      "text": "to the standard of care (the WHO recommended regimen of six months of treatment with rifampicin,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.998799324035645,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.49464416503906,
        527.191162109375,
        195.93763732910156
      ],
      "text": "isoniazid, pyrazinamide and ethambutol) and thus the regimen was the one reviewed by the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        194.69459533691406,
        527.5088500976562,
        209.13758850097656
      ],
      "text": "GDG. This regimen consisted of eight weeks of daily isoniazid (H), rifapentine (P), moxifloxacin",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        207.8946075439453,
        527.4014282226562,
        222.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "(M) and pyrazinamide (Z), followed by nine weeks of daily isoniazid, rifapentine, and moxifloxacin",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        221.09474182128906,
        527.4497680664062,
        235.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "(2PHZM/2PHM). The dose of rifapentine used was 1200 mg daily. The primary efficacy end point of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        234.29469299316406,
        527.403564453125,
        248.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "Study 31 was TB disease-free survival at 12 months after randomization, while the primary safety",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        247.4947052001953,
        527.3739013671875,
        261.9377136230469
      ],
      "text": "end point was the proportion of participants with grade 3 or higher adverse events during the study",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        260.6947021484375,
        142.84127807617188,
        275.1377258300781
      ],
      "text": "drug treatment.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        282.39862060546875,
        527.636474609375,
        296.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "In the trial, a total of 2 516 patients from 34 sites (in Brazil, China, Haiti, India, Kenya, Malawi,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        295.5986328125,
        527.43115234375,
        310.0416564941406
      ],
      "text": "Peru, South Africa, Thailand, Uganda, USA, Viet Nam and Zimbabwe) were randomly assigned to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        308.798583984375,
        527.4354858398438,
        323.2416076660156
      ],
      "text": "a treatment group. The microbiologically eligible population  included 791 patients with TB in the  7",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        321.99859619140625,
        527.4124145507812,
        336.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "rifapentine-moxifloxacin arm and 768 in the standard of care control arm. The GDG accepted the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        335.1986083984375,
        527.4305419921875,
        349.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "outcomes used by the Study 31 for analysis, using the microbiologically eligible population as defined",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.979881286621094,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        348.39862060546875,
        527.2694702148438,
        362.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "by the study to minimize bias, and using the safety analysis population (as defined by the study",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        361.5986022949219,
        527.4014892578125,
        376.0416259765625
      ],
      "text": "protocol) for the review of all-cause mortality and adverse events. The proportion of patients who",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        374.7986145019531,
        527.5477905273438,
        389.24163818359375
      ],
      "text": "were cured  was similar in both arms (84.5% in the rifapentine-moxifloxacin arm versus 85.4% for the  8",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.99905014038086,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        387.99859619140625,
        527.4990234375,
        402.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "standard of care, relative risk (RR) 0.99, 95% CI: 0.95–1.03). Retention on treatment was high for both",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.999350547790527,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        401.1986083984375,
        527.392333984375,
        415.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "arms, namely: 99.7% for the rifapentine-moxifloxacin arm and 99.0% for the standard of care arm",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        414.39862060546875,
        527.4332275390625,
        428.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "(RR: 1.01, 95% CI: 1.00–1.02). All-cause mortality recorded within 14 days after the end of treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        427.5986022949219,
        527.38916015625,
        442.0416259765625
      ],
      "text": "was reported for 0.4% of patients in the rifapentine-moxifloxacin arm versus 0.8% in the standard",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        440.7986145019531,
        527.3859252929688,
        455.24163818359375
      ],
      "text": "of care (RR 0.42, 95% CI: 0.11–1.61); and grade 3 or higher adverse events were noted in 18.8% of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        453.99859619140625,
        527.4223022460938,
        468.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "participants in the rifapentine-moxifloxacin arm versus 19.3% in the standard of care arm (RR 0.97,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        467.1986083984375,
        527.4036865234375,
        481.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "95% CI: 0.76–1.24). There were no statistically significant differences in the proportion of patients",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        480.39862060546875,
        527.5947875976562,
        494.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "who were cured when comparing the rifapentine-moxifloxacin arm to the standard of care arm for all",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.991146087646484,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        493.5986022949219,
        527.4244995117188,
        508.0416259765625
      ],
      "text": "four subgroups that were analysed (persons living with HIV infection; persons with extensive disease,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        506.798583984375,
        527.4530029296875,
        521.2415771484375
      ],
      "text": "based on extent of disease on chest radiography, persons with diabetes mellitus; and persons with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        519.9985961914062,
        527.2329711914062,
        534.4415893554688
      ],
      "text": "a low body weight, less than 17.9 kg/m3). There was little or no difference in all-cause mortality",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        533.1986083984375,
        527.3903198242188,
        547.6416015625
      ],
      "text": "and adverse events during treatment – a slight increase in retention on treatment was noted in the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        546.3986206054688,
        527.4234619140625,
        560.8416137695312
      ],
      "text": "rifapentine-moxifloxacin arm (RR 1.01, 95% CI: 1–1.02) and the evidence was uncertain with regard",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        559.5986328125,
        222.06991577148438,
        574.0416259765625
      ],
      "text": "to acquisition of drug resistance.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        581.302490234375,
        527.3937377929688,
        595.7454833984375
      ],
      "text": "The GDG judged that the benefits of a shorter, 4-month regimen that is as effective as the currently",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        594.5026245117188,
        527.4156494140625,
        608.9456176757812
      ],
      "text": "recommended 6-month regimen would justify the introduction of the shorter regimen as an option",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        607.70263671875,
        220.25491333007812,
        622.1456298828125
      ],
      "text": "for treating patients with DS-TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        629.406494140625,
        527.4432373046875,
        643.8494873046875
      ],
      "text": "Certain contextual issues were discussed that resulted in a conditional recommendation, rather than",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        642.6065063476562,
        205.9373016357422,
        657.0494995117188
      ],
      "text": "a strong one. These included:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        664.200439453125,
        527.380859375,
        678.75341796875
      ],
      "text": "Resources:  The costs related to the use of this regimen are currently high and further research is",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        677.5103759765625,
        527.4036254882812,
        691.953369140625
      ],
      "text": "needed on resource implications (e.g. patient and health system savings) and cost-effectiveness of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        721.4371337890625,
        526.6135864257812,
        731.9411010742188
      ],
      "text": "The microbiologically eligible population excludes persons with resistance to the medicines used for treatment; those with no baseline  7",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        731.037109375,
        526.5880737304688,
        741.5410766601562
      ],
      "text": "positive TB culture and others that were not eligible to participate in the trial. The choice of a microbiologically eligible population for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        740.6371459960938,
        524.28125,
        751.14111328125
      ],
      "text": "the analyses minimizes the chance of underestimating the effect of the rifapentine-moxifloxacin in view of the non-inferiority trial design.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 7.986187934875488,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        753.0718994140625,
        526.574951171875,
        763.5758666992188
      ],
      "text": "The outcome, named ‘cure’ or ‘favorable’ outcome in the Study 31, was chosen as it was prioritized by the GDG. The definition of the  8",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        762.6719360351562,
        458.2909851074219,
        773.1759033203125
      ],
      "text": "favorable outcome is detailed in the Study 31 protocol and the Evidence-to Decisions tables for this GDG review.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        320.85479736328125,
        801.0170288085938,
        554.0401611328125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "Chapter 1 Drug-susceptible TB treatment: Recommendations 15",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}